imprimir("║  2. canal    — Canais assíncronos (Go-like)          ║")
imprimir("║  3. eventos  — Event Bus reativo com wildcards       ║")
imprimir("║  4. stream   — Lazy streams com 15+ operadores       ║")
imprimir("║  5. deco     — Decoradores: memo, log, retry, timer  ║")
imprimir("║  6. fsm      — Máquina de estados finitos            ║")
imprimir("║  7. obs      — Observáveis (RxJS-like)               ║")
imprimir("║  8. contrato — Design by Contract (DbC)              ║")
